# Production parts for the multi-object 3MF plate deliverable,
# build/hex-bit-rail-plate.3mf (scripts/plate.sh, gate.sh --check).
#
# The two rails print SEPARATELY (short-bit rail + long-bit rail). A single
# STL of both imports into the slicer as ONE fused body and prints welded —
# the multi-part-fuse field test. The plate packs them as N distinct objects
# the slicer imports as N parts; the assembled render stays a preview.
#
# A subset of ci.parts: the coupon and the fit proofs are NOT plate parts.
rail-short
rail-long
